  "definition": "Maximum Sulfur Content Allowable in Coal",
  "effectiveDate": "2023-11-18",
  "historyNote": "#6519-B, eff 5-29-97 (from Env-A 402.02); ss by #8330, eff 4-23-05; ss by #10415, eff 9-24-13 (from Env-A 1606.01); ss by #12694, eff 12-22-18; ss by #13808, eff 11-18-23",
